<http://data.silknow.org/object/0a93cf05-91d1-3ce6-b423-734d83827f9a>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Image figure representing the Virgin Mary, polychromed wood, wax and cloth in embroidered silk clothing"@en , "Religious figure depicting the Virgin Mary. Carved, gessoed and polychromed wood, with golden hair that seems to be modelled wax. Cloth covered wire legs with wax high-heeled shoes covered in cloth, doll attached to white-painted wood plinth with wire supports wrapped in pink silk thread.Wearing a white silk dress embroidered with polychrome silk embroidery and metal thread in a flower and pineapple motif, and a blue silk cloak edged with silver thread embroidery. Metal crown (damaged)"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/e1b3f52f-c6d0-3543-ae93-2acdde64c4bc> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/965b5dbd-ccbe-3162-ba40-ab371c04df90> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/f65f7f2d-abc4-3c7b-9801-e36890db2397> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/10b772de-6c5b-3eca-ab5c-e354e3ff4f84> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Image figure representing the Virgin Mary, polychromed wood, wax and cloth in embroidered silk clothing"@en , "Religious figure depicting the Virgin Mary. Carved, gessoed and polychromed wood, with golden hair that seems to be modelled wax. Cloth covered wire legs with wax high-heeled shoes covered in cloth, doll attached to white-painted wood plinth with wire supports wrapped in pink silk thread.Wearing a white silk dress embroidered with polychrome silk embroidery and metal thread in a flower and pineapple motif, and a blue silk cloak edged with silver thread embroidery. Metal crown (damaged)"@en ;
